flowchart TD
    Start([run create]) --> Source{Dataset already finalized?}
    Source -- No --> Ingest[Bounded ingestion into immutable case files]
    Source -- Yes --> Catalog[Verify catalog and physical storage binding]
    Ingest --> Catalog --> Freeze[Freeze profile, evaluator artifacts and initial placements]
    Freeze --> Prepare[Verify cases and publish immutable configuration and plan]
    Prepare --> Hold{Prepare only?}
    Hold -- Yes --> Held([Creating run with held ready plan])
    Hold -- No --> Seed[Seed bounded execution-local metadata pages]
    Seed --> Verify{Exact local chunk coverage?}
    Verify -- Yes --> Activate[Publish routes and cursors with pending state]
    Activate --> Pending([Pending run])
    Verify -- Incomplete --> Recover([Creating run for requested admission recovery])
    Source -. Invalid input .-> Error([Creation error with retained recovery identity])
    Catalog -. Binding or integrity failure .-> Error
    Prepare -. Invalid case, identity or lease .-> Error
    Seed -. Availability failure .-> Recover
    Seed -. Immutable conflict .-> Failed([Failed run, no dispatch])
